mod:lib;

// `nparse` — the umbrella. A consumer imports this file by a relative path (`meta/specs/BUILD.md`
// B-16) and reaches the public surface through it.
//
// IT RE-EXPORTS NOTHING YET, AND THAT IS DELIBERATE (cycle 0.0.1's plan). `use` is not transitive
// (the compiler's `MODULE_REFERENCE.md` §2.3), so the public surface is a list in this one file, one
// `pub use` per name, written by the cycle that makes the name public — cycle 0.1's cursor first.
// A list a reviewer reads in one place is the reason the library has an umbrella at all.
